  "share_of_ultimate and ci95 copied verbatim from ci.json (Keenable-published).",
  "overall_share_of_ultimate = unweighted mean of the 5 per-bench point shares, recomputed by G2 to mirror the page's 'mean share of ultimate across 5 verticals'; may differ slightly from the page's on-screen number.",
  "raw_7d_mean = num_scored-weighted mean of the bench metric over the CI runs (same as the page's wmean).",
  "latency medians are medians of per-run p50/p95 reported in history.jsonl; network vantage of the benchmark runner is not documented (UNKNOWN).",
  "'ultimate' = oracle pooling best results of all engines, ranked by the same LLM judge; not a real engine.",
  "prices: NEEDLE page PRICES map, collected 2026-08-21, 'biggest self-serve tier, no enterprise quotes'.",
